{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "3ddf3f59cb50febfe7b6e882db7af2ab7ecc25001bd9ace8c6391dddedba233b", "ja": "ふっふっふ……待っていたよ。\n{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……我等你很久了哦。\n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b8f881368fc8f2c113c8cd3b428607bee0f25f5aa90ec4578be377f1ab0f75f1", "ja": "待っていた……？\n衣装に何か問題でもあったのか？", "zh": "在等我……？\n是服装出什么问题了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "74aeeeaa359b44ea502a5045d5b3e10af318371ab952571d0b3254fb9bc76de8", "ja": "問題なんてないよ！\n茜ちゃんが言いたいのは、その逆だよ！　逆！", "zh": "怎么可能有问题嘛！\n小茜想说的正好相反啦！相反！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "f2defe90b53b89106d416ec6ea7133161f562691ac8fc2c99eec47e681836efe", "ja": "こんなにカワイイ衣装を用意してくれたから、\nほめてあげようと思って！", "zh": "因为你为我准备了这么可爱的服装，\n所以我想夸夸你嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_1004_p", "source_sha256": "dcdd28802fef3de966eafa5c1b81041288f9c4326314789e175d989a3cd155b4", "ja": "そういうことだったのか。\n衣装、喜んでもらえたみたいで良かったよ。", "zh": "原来是这么回事啊。\n看起来你很喜欢这套服装，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "0113c3831a4f8d45aaf846d93b44e298d771083dca0b333502e916902941d226", "ja": "さすがだよ、{$P$}ちゃん！\nよっ、敏腕！　……それじゃ突然だけど、クイズね♪", "zh": "不愧是你，{$P$}！\n哟，能干的制作人！……那就突然来道题吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ced44d5344220e4443fc1a0789c89caf7314c6f34b4dbb9a466ec53119aa9a36", "ja": "本当に突然だな……。\nよし、いいぞ！", "zh": "确实很突然啊……\n好，来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "efa44d980f79327a276b2c7dbdb869aa6ca9f045c2613b0c3fb7cbeb2a014472", "ja": "わかった人は挙手すること。……問題です！\n『世界一猫耳が似合うプリティな女の子はだ～れだ？』", "zh": "知道答案的人请举手。……现在出题！\n“世界上最适合戴猫耳的可爱女孩是谁呀？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_1008", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_2000_p", "source_sha256": "b826a1ab4a68b13f236c8dc6b0570f17bc0c18ec84aec94a974f102b2f73a8e7", "ja": "もちろん……野々原茜！", "zh": "当然是……野野原茜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_2001_023aka", "source_sha256": "2061a2e2a54718ddff681e53e0434785205e18fec55435f2b7577c271e4b2007", "ja": "大大大正～解！　まあ、簡単すぎちゃったよね……。\nそれに猫耳以外、しっぽだって世界一似合うし……。", "zh": "大大大正～确！哎呀，确实是太简单了呢……\n而且除了猫耳，小茜戴尾巴也是世界第一合适……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_2002_023aka", "source_sha256": "fa689487795a4b3700cc9f157815bf23cdbd495a4a28aa512e9b4b8e8d74de66", "ja": "だからこそ、茜ちゃんがこの衣装を着ると\nカワイさが倍、いや、100万倍になってしまう！", "zh": "正因为如此，小茜穿上这套服装后，可爱度会翻倍，不，甚至会变成100万倍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_2003_p", "source_sha256": "0782dc1d19e18cfdc404ca6bf32f2e8079556c185e51831c5335fce63149ba87", "ja": "そうだな。茜らしさがいっぱい詰まった、\n茜にしか着こなせない衣装だと思うよ。", "zh": "没错。这套服装充满了茜的风格，我觉得只有茜才能穿出它的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_2004_023aka", "source_sha256": "700ae707c92dcdb9bcdf1fd0e843af0f41c4ad1e9e8e848971e7439858c08710", "ja": "でしょ？　こんなにカワイイ茜ちゃんを見ちゃったら\n……思いっきりナデナデしたくなるよね？", "zh": "对吧？看到这么可爱的小茜……就会忍不住想好好摸摸吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_2005_p", "source_sha256": "07989cd9f288e17457f7c6a7b18b6ca6b1610c3e9be6a7d4cc06294af19a1439", "ja": "ああ。きっとファンの人達も、\nナデナデしてあげたいって思うだろうな。", "zh": "啊。粉丝们肯定也会想摸摸她吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_2006_023aka", "source_sha256": "6ee8f47877bb1d3925775e682c277b8299ca9bc5e49c3f2c8981dcaeb5e3144d", "ja": "そうだよね♪　じゃあ、茜ちゃんをナデナデしたい\nっていう、全人類共通の願いを叶えてあげなきゃ！", "zh": "对呀♪那就得帮全人类实现“想摸摸小茜”这个共同愿望才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_2007_023aka", "source_sha256": "385aec24e898f742774ead9bfe304119f88d92eb05b661d91307b147bc06e118", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんに提案です！\nこの衣装の茜ちゃん人形を、劇場で売ってみない？", "zh": "给{$P$}提个建议！\n要不要在剧场卖这套服装的小茜人偶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_2008_p", "source_sha256": "20d43ddd0edfa392ddb0c0828de62345d42f6f06553167fd24f67ab6960326ee", "ja": "茜ちゃん人形の新作ってことか……。\nなるほど……うん、いいかもしれないな。", "zh": "是小茜人偶的新款吗……。原来如此……嗯，或许不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_2009_023aka", "source_sha256": "f811f60b73198f45f1d28178b5a8e77879a7469c5823749466c8ab5119db19b3", "ja": "えっ、いいの？　ホントに？\n……やったー！　じゃあじゃあ、今回は何体作る？", "zh": "咦，可以吗？真的吗？\n……太好了！那么这次要做多少个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_2010_023aka", "source_sha256": "6fdbb8ee42c7ad2c1f10ea7328997f60b539e32f1c8876783f49275cf670be87", "ja": "1万……いや、100万！　いやいや、もっと！\n全人類が、ナデナデできるようにしないとね！", "zh": "1万……不，100万！不不，还要更多！\n得让全人类都能摸摸头才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_2011_p", "source_sha256": "0cbb4e48c748a68fef9c3cda04496b358cedc5e3f87ecc3f090a7270322ddee5", "ja": "ちょっと待った！　話を進める前に、\nまずは社長に相談をだな……茜、話を聞いてくれー！", "zh": "等等！在继续之前，先得去跟社长商量一下……茜，你听我说——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0324_2012_p", "source_sha256": "9df66c1f1794719a3e347169354204cacab9845e3cc3b635b0d78a972e6d4cbf", "ja": "（なんとか人形の大量発注を防ぐことができた……。\nきっとそれだけ、衣装を気に入ったって事だな）", "zh": "（总算设法避免了大量订购那种人偶……\n看来她一定是很喜欢这套服装吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
